      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://kids.kiddle.co/Elmhurst,_Sacramento,_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1966, Charles Goethe donated a historic house to Sacramento State University, linking Elmhurst to higher education.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
