      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://kids.kiddle.co/Elmhurst,_Sacramento,_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Elmhurst is home to Sacramento Public Access, the city’s public television station that broadcasts local programming.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
