      ],
      "source": "https://kids.kiddle.co/Elmhurst,_Sacramento,_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The neighborhood once stretched north to the Southern Pacific Railroad line, now bounded by the 48th Street light rail stop.",
